<% content_for :reason, "You're getting this because you can approve work for #{@engagement.client.name}." %>
Hi <%= @link.contact.name.split.first %>,

<%= @engagement.title %> (<%= @engagement.ref %>) is ready for your decision. Read it through, then approve it or ask for changes:

<%= approval_url(@link.token) %>

The link is yours alone and works until <%= l @link.expires_at.in_time_zone.to_date, format: :long %>.
